text = "Design freely, then construct ships in Fleet using materials and credits.
Each ship needs one connected command center: 2 ? 2 green squares.
Drag ships in Fleet to arrange their formation, then Deploy.
Lost components stop working; disconnected sections become salvage.
Repair surviving ships for credits. Blue armor is inexpensive to repair.
Drag or WASD / arrows to pan. Wheel zooms. Space follows a ship.
Laser upgrades spend red materials and credits."
